cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its benchmarks, please cite it as below, and cite the MaleCNS connectome it is built on and the gustatory connectome paper that assigns taste modality to it (see references)."
title: "flycns: a benchmarked spiking simulation of the Drosophila male central nervous system"
abstract: "flycns simulates the whole central nervous system of the male fruit fly, brain and nerve cord, as a network of spiking neurons wired, with excitatory or inhibitory sign, as the Janelia MaleCNS v1.0 connectome maps them. Its circuits are scored against published recordings from real flies in a benchmark suite whose pass/fail criteria are, for many checks, committed to git before the test runs."
type: software
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-10-11"
